Package: homecontrol
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser, ca-certificates
Description: HomeControl smart-home controller as a Linux service
 The runtime of a smart home that E-Home engineers: KNX over KNXnet/IP, rules,
 schedules, the web UI for the inhabitants, MQTT, external values and the
 E-Home connection, the same controller as the ESP32-C6 firmware. Zigbee needs
 the controller's radio and is not available on Linux.
 .
 The service listens on port 8081 (the WebSocket on 8082); its data lives in
 /var/lib/homecontrol.
